%% Chief OS — action → approval → provenance
%% Embedded in: docs/02-architecture.md, docs/06-security-model.md
sequenceDiagram
    participant Ag as Agent (L2)
    participant CB as Capability Broker (L2)
    participant RR as Region Router (L2)
    participant TLD as Trust Ledger (L2)
    participant Srf as Surface (L4)
    participant Hum as Human
    participant SE as Secure Enclave / YubiKey
    participant PL as Provenance Log (L2)
    participant MG as Memory Graph (L2)

    Ag->>CB: propose(action, metadata)
    CB->>CB: verify caps
    CB->>TLD: read delegation
    CB->>RR: classify(action, ledger, horizon)
    RR-->>Srf: dispatch(region, friction_tier)
    Srf->>Hum: render approval UI (if needed)
    Hum->>Srf: approve / reject / rewind
    Srf->>SE: sign(payload, biometric)
    SE-->>Srf: signed approval token
    Srf->>CB: present token (single-use)
    CB->>Ag: execute or cancel
    Ag->>PL: signed receipt (in-toto v1)
    Ag->>MG: write outcome (provenance ref)
    PL-->>TLD: success → record_approval(category)
